-	 * We first generate m 16-bit value. Values 0..n-1 go to x[].
-	 * Values n..2*n-1 go to tt1[]. Values 2*n and later go to tt2[].
-	 * We also reduce modulo q the values; rejected values are set
-	 * to 0xFFFF.
-	 */
