-	 * First iteration: compute f[j] + i * f[j+N/2] for all j < N/2
-	 * (because GM[1] = w^rev(1) = w^(N/2) = i).
-	 * In our chosen representation, this is a no-op: everything is
-	 * already where it should be.
-	 */
